&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Dexory, we&#39;re developing advanced software powered by cutting-edge robots that are transforming the very face of global logistics. With infectious enthusiasm, our unique blend of disciplines work in harmony to produce results at pace. From hardware and manufacturing to software, AI and commercial, we&#39;re one team – one heart – that beats, learns and grows together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re only interested in the best ideas, no matter where they&#39;re from. We&#39;re doers. Game-changers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out-of-the-box thinkers who put merit before all else. A group of ambitious and disciplined individuals who are passionate about turning theory into rubber, metal and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only with immense heat and pressure are diamonds formed, and our high-performance, high-reward culture isnʼt for everyone. We bend the rules. We say it as it is. We donʼt quit. We keep ego and bureaucracy in check to help our operation stay agile and performing at its peak. We&#39;re a place where careers are defined, and we&#39;ll give you all the tools youʼll need to make your mark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity doesnʼt present itself everyday. This is your chance to be a part of something truly revolutionary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The foundations for success have been laid, but we&#39;re only just getting started. Are you ready for the fight?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*We value the right attitude, humility and we&#39;re as interested in your character as we are in your talent. Please apply, even if you feel you only meet part of our listed criteria. Diversity drives innovation and we offer an international and friendly work environment with an energetic company culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Dexory, we are on a mission to be the most dominant player in warehouse intelligence globally. As a Product Manager, you will operate across multiple product streams under a clear vision, elevate execution standards and best practice, and turn customer and data insight into measurable business outcomes. You’ll be the connective tissue across engineering, design, research, commercial, and operations - raising the bar for strategy, delivery, and culture while helping coach other PMs to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale strategy &amp;amp; vision: Connect adjacent product areas under a coherent strategy and outcome-based OKRs; facilitate domain-level planning that influences company priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution excellence: Own delivery health across multiple product areas; remove systemic blockers; establish consistent planning, reporting and launch practices that others adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data &amp;amp; insight: Ensure every initiative has clear success metrics; run portfolio reviews; help teams move debates from opinion to evidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer &amp;amp; market leadership: Scale discovery standards; maintain senior customer relationships; ensure roadmaps tie to validated insight and commercial value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence &amp;amp; alignment: Orchestrate complex stakeholder ecosystems; create clarity in ambiguity; communicate progress and trade-offs to senior leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; growth: Build experimentation frameworks; scale what works; evaluate new opportunities that strengthen Dexory’s category leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Product Management with demonstrable impact in B2B platforms (automation, AI/ML, data or industrial domains a plus).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record aligning multiple teams around a clear strategy and delivering complex, cross-functional initiatives to measurable outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data fluency: defining KPI trees, running post-launch analyses/experiments, and leading portfolio-level reviews that inform investment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in discovery: turning qualitative and quantitative insight into opportunity statements and roadmaps tied to commercial value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder skills: influencing without authority, resolving high-stakes conflicts with empathy and evidence, and communicating at exec level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at the intersection of hardware and software, or deploying AI/analytics in operational environments is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate by four principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance. Impact. Commitment. One Team.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Dexory isn’t just about having expertise… it’s about embracing uncertainty with purpose. You’ll&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;help define not only our products, but the future of autonomous logistics itself. From day one, you’ll be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;trusted to push boundaries, take ownership, and deliver breakthrough results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare via Bupa with 24/7 medical helpline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension: 4+% employee with option to opt into salary exchange, 5% employer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme - mental wellbeing, financial and legal advice/support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 holidays per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full meals onsite in Wallingford&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun team events on and offsite, snacks of all kinds in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
